{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48895","headline":"和友人题僧院蔷薇花三首 二 · 崔橹","name":"和友人题僧院蔷薇花三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忍委芳心此地开，似霞颜色苦低回。\n风惊少女偷香去，雨认巫娥觅伴来。\n今日独怜僧院种，旧山曾映钓矶栽。\n三清上客知惆怅，劝我春醪一两杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}